  "job_B15.8.557_20260920_210343": {
    "text": "Eowlangelad Ealhstan.\n\u00c6\u00feelstan.\n\u00d0is synd \u00fea land gem\u00e6re \u00e6t eowlan gelade.\nOf eowlan gelade andlang bladene.\nOf bladene andlang ri\u00feiges \u00fe on fugel m\u00e6re midne.\nOf fulgel mere \u00fe on \u00feone o\u00feerne fugel mere.\nOf fugel mere \u00fe on gild beorh.\nOf gild beorh andlang sealtstr\u00e6te to \u00fean stane.\nOf \u00fean stane to \u00fean o\u00feeran stane \u00fe swa to \u00fean \u00feriddan stane, & to \u00fean feor\u00f0an stane.\nOf \u00feam stane to \u00fe\u00e6re grenan stige.\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re stige to lafercan beorh.\nOf lafercan beorh on \u00feone ealdan weg \u00fe ofer \u00feone broc \u00fe eft on \u00feone ealdan weg.\nOf \u00feam ealdan wege \u00fe for\u00f0 onlang dune a bi heafdan \u00fe hit cym\u00f0 to \u00fean ealdan slo.\nOf \u00fean slo to \u00fean lytlan beorhe, of \u00fean beorge on \u00fe sic.\nOndlong sices ofer \u00feone broc to heort wellan.\nOf heort wellan to hwete wellan, & \u00fereo \u00e6ceras ear\u00f0landes of hwete wellan a bi \u00fean ear\u00f0lande to \u00fean to\nOf \u00fean beorge for\u00f0 on geriht on \u00fe\u00e6t sic.\nOf \u00feam sice be \u00fean heafdan \u00fe hit cym\u00f0 to mules hlawe, & \u00fereo \u00e6ceras \u00feonne adune andlang \u00fe\u00e6re furh\nSwa andlang bladene \u00fe hit cym\u00f0 eft to eowlan gelade.",
